sequenceDiagram
  participant TenantAUser as Tenant A User
  participant TenantBUser as Tenant B User
  participant API as API Gateway
  participant Filter as TenantContext Filter
  participant Service as Business Service
  participant DB as MariaDB

  Note over API,DB: Tenant A - Legitimate Access
  TenantAUser->>API: GET /scim/v2/Users/me
  Note over TenantAUser: JWT with tenant_id=A
  API->>Filter: Intercept request
  Filter->>Filter: Extract tenant_id from JWT
  Filter->>Filter: Validate tenant exists & active
  Filter->>Service: Set TenantContext(tenant_id=A)
  Service->>DB: SELECT * FROM external_users WHERE tenant_id='A'
  DB->>Service: Tenant A's users
  Service->>TenantAUser: 200 OK (Tenant A data)

  Note over API,DB: Tenant B - Legitimate Access
  TenantBUser->>API: GET /scim/v2/Users/me
  Note over TenantBUser: JWT with tenant_id=B
  API->>Filter: Intercept request
  Filter->>Filter: Extract tenant_id=B
  Filter->>Filter: Validate tenant exists & active
  Filter->>Service: Set TenantContext(tenant_id=B)
  Service->>DB: SELECT * FROM external_users WHERE tenant_id='B'
  DB->>Service: Tenant B's users (completely isolated)
  Service->>TenantBUser: 200 OK (Tenant B data)

  Note over API,DB: Tenant B attempting cross-tenant access to Tenant A resource
  TenantBUser->>API: GET /scim/v2/Users/TENANT_A_USER_ID
  Note over TenantBUser: JWT with tenant_id=B but requests Tenant A's resource
  API->>Filter: Intercept request
  Filter->>Filter: Set TenantContext(tenant_id=B)
  Filter->>Service: findUserById(TENANT_A_USER_ID)
  Service->>DB: SELECT * FROM external_users WHERE id=TENANT_A_USER_ID AND tenant_id='B'
  DB->>Service: Empty result (user belongs to tenant A)
  Service->>Filter: User not found
  Filter->>TenantBUser: 404 Not Found (tenant-agnostic error)
